<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`keepUntracked` keeps a dropped carrier's untracked file and raises one alert per path; `untrackedCarriers` lists every untracked file under each mirror root for the census. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

